			(property "Description" "Tantalum Capacitors\n\nWave footprints have larger pads and are meant to be used for hand soldering. Reflow footprints are optimised for solder paste and a reflow oven.\n\nEIA3216-18/A-[R/W] - Size A / 3216-18 / 1206 footprint\n\n• 4.7µF 25V 10% Tantalum Capacitor\n• 10µF 16V 10% Tantalum Capacitor [Digikey: 495-2236-2-ND]\n\nEIA3528-21/B-[R/W] - Size B / 3528-21\n\n• 47µF 10V 10% Tantalum Capactior [Digikey: 495-2216-1-ND]\n\nEIA6032-28/C-[R/W] - Size C / 6032-28\n\n• 10µF 35V 20% Tantalum Capacitor [Digikey: 495-2285-1-ND]\n• 100µF 16V 10% Tantalum Capactior [Digikey: 399-5214-1-ND]"
